# Outlook India

> Outlook India is one of India's leading digital news and magazine publishers, covering national and international news, politics, economy, sports, entertainment, lifestyle, technology, education, opinion, and magazine features.

Outlook India publishes verified journalism across breaking news, long-form reporting, interviews, opinion, explainers, magazine editions, photo stories, videos, and multimedia features. Content is updated throughout the day by the editorial newsroom and follows established editorial standards.

